# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OnTrack — .gitignore
#
# Written BEFORE `git init` deliberately: once a secret has been committed it
# lives in the repository history forever, and removing it means rewriting
# history. Preventing the first commit is the only cheap fix.
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Secrets ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Deny the whole .env family, then re-admit the one safe file.
#
# The earlier version listed variants individually (.env, .env.local,
# .env.development ...) and would NOT have caught .env.test — which holds a
# real database password. Enumerating known names is the wrong shape for this
# rule: it fails silently the first time someone invents a new suffix.
.env*
!.env.example

# Azure / auth artefacts that occasionally get written into the project folder
*.pem
*.pfx
*.p12
*.key
azure.json
local.settings.json

# ── Dependencies ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.pnp
.pnp.js
.yarn/install-state.gz

# ── Next.js build output ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
.next/
out/
build/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# ── Prisma ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The generated client is a build artefact — it is regenerated from
# schema.prisma by `prisma generate` on every install and build.
# NOTE: prisma/migrations/ is NOT ignored. Migrations are source code; a fresh
# environment must be reproducible from them.
/generated/
node_modules/.prisma/

# Local database dumps. prisma/sql/*.sql is deliberately NOT matched here —
# those are hand-written migration constraints and must be committed.
*.dump
*.backup
pgdata/

# ── Test & coverage ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
coverage/
.nyc_output/
test-results/
playwright-report/

# ── Logs ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# ── Editors ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
# VS Code: share the useful bits, ignore personal settings
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/launch.json
# Claude Code's local tooling config. Machine-specific and auto-generated —
# the launch.json it writes defaults to port 3000, while this project serves
# on 3100, so committing it would hand the next person a config that silently
# points at the wrong place.
.claude/

# ── OS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store

# ── Misc ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.local
.cache/
tmp/
temp/
